      "attack_scenario": "Attacker sends P2P data availability sample with commitment=0xc00000...(infinity) plus arbitrary cell data and proof. Batch verification accepts the infinity commitment (bytes.c:90), aggregates it into random linear combination where it contributes zero, while weighted proof remains. Invalid cell data passes verification because commitment term vanishes from pairing equation.",
      "checklist_id": "PROP-57888860-inv-053"
